    "message": "Game ended (spectator exited with code -1)"
  },
  "harnessEpoch": 20,
  "youtubeUrl": "https://youtu.be/W6X1aYhEHvM",
  "annotations": [
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT52 Nature targeted itself with Lightning Bolt, dealing 3 damage to themselves for no benefit. The Lightning Bolt was cast during combat where Goblin Engineer is blocked by Orcish Bowmasters and Orc Army Token (a 2/2 with +1/+1 counter). The Goblin Engineer (1/2) is going to die in combat regardless. By targeting the Orc Army Token, the bolt could have killed it, saving the Goblin Engineer from lethal combat damage (it would only take 1 from Bowmasters, surviving as a 1/2). Alternatively, targeting Orcish Bowmasters would kill it. Instead, GPT52 Nature wasted a Lightning Bolt dealing 3 damage to themselves while losing their Goblin Engineer in combat.",
      "actionTaken": "Targeted themselves (GPT52 Nature) with Lightning Bolt, taking 3 self-damage for no reason.",
      "betterLine": "Target Orc Army Token with Lightning Bolt to kill it, allowing Goblin Engineer to survive combat by only taking 1 damage from Orcish Bowmasters. Alternatively, target Orcish Bowmasters to remove that threat.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshotIndex": 138,
      "player": "GPT52 Nature",
      "decisionIndex": 79
    }
  ],
